  keywords={Joining processes;Oscillators;Couplings;Frequency;Transistors;Noise;Solids;Transformers;Weighted sum model;Current;Chip area;dual-injection coupling;frequency tuning range (FTR);mode ambiguity;multiphase;noise circulating;oscillator;phase accuracy;phase noise (PN);power budget;quad-core;windmill-shaping transformer},
